.TH "ZYPPER\-LOG" "8" "2026-09-04" "SUSE Linux" "ZYPPER"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el       .ds Aq '
.ss \n[.ss] 0
.nh
.ad l
.de URL
\fI\\$2\fP <\\$1>\\$3
..
.als MTO URL
.if \n[.g] \{\
